<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AWA to trial game at Circus casinos.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AWA to trial game at Circus casinos.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics and gaming machine maker AWA Ltd said it will trial its Club Keno game at casinos operated by Circus Circus Enterprises in the U.S.</p>
<p>&quot;The success on the trialling of our game would auger well for the future,&quot; said AWA's new managing director John Rouse told reporters after the company announced a net loss of A$14.26 million in the year to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
